        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Each employee with a spouse (or same-gender domestic partner) enrolled in a Company-sponsored plan must provide information regarding coverage available through another employer to determine whether or not special contributions are required to enroll the spouse. If the employee does not authorize a required contribution, the spouse will not be enrolled for medical coverage. The employee will not be able to enroll the spouse until the earlier of:",
