            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If an employee has a new dependent as a result of marriage, entering into a same-gender domestic partner relationship, birth, adoption, or placement for adoption, the employee may enroll the new dependent during the year as long as enrollment is requested within one hundred twenty (120) days after the qualified event. See \"Changes in Status,\" Section 3.F, for more information.",
